# The smugglers' landing (worlds/01_PIER.md, Key 2): the last of the crew has tied himself up, practising.

~ practised
Goon: Psst. Psst! Over here.
Goon: Before you start. I've been practising. For when the Rope came. So I'd be ready.
Nim: You tied yourself up.
Goon: Is it right? The book said a figure-eight with a loop through the middle. Be honest.
Nim: ...It's not bad.
Goon [happy]: Thanks. Could you tell the police I did it myself? I'd like the credit.
